{"title": "Defence Ministry Approves Over Rs 1 Lakh Crore in Acquisitions", "summary": "India's Defence Ministry has approved military purchase proposals totaling over Rs 1 lakh crore, with a significant portion, Rs 52,000 crore, allocated for equipment upgrades. The acquisitions aim to strengthen national borders and enhance military capabilities across all domains, with a notable emphasis on indigenous procurement and self-reliance in defence manufacturing.", "summary_points": ["Defence Ministry approved proposals exceeding Rs 1 lakh crore.", "Rs 52,000 crore specifically allocated for equipment upgrades.", "Acquisitions aim to strengthen India's borders.", "Emphasis placed on indigenous procurement and self-reliance.", "Key acquisitions include missiles and air defence systems.", "A Defence Panel will consider further proposals on Friday."], "title_hi": "रक्षा मंत्रालय ने 1 लाख करोड़ रुपये से अधिक की खरीद को मंजूरी दी", "summary_hi": "भारत के रक्षा मंत्रालय ने 1 लाख करोड़ रुपये से अधिक के सैन्य खरीद प्रस्तावों को मंजूरी दी है, जिसमें से 52,000 करोड़ रुपये उपकरण उन्नयन के लिए आवंटित किए गए हैं। इन अधिग्रहणों का उद्देश्य राष्ट्रीय सीमाओं को मजबूत करना और सभी क्षेत्रों में सैन्य क्षमताओं को बढ़ाना है, जिसमें स्वदेशी खरीद और रक्षा विनिर्माण में आत्मनिर्भरता पर विशेष जोर दिया गया है।", "summary_points_hi": ["रक्षा मंत्रालय ने 1 लाख करोड़ रुपये से अधिक के प्रस्तावों को मंजूरी दी।", "उपकरण उन्नयन के लिए विशेष रूप से 52,000 करोड़ रुपये आवंटित किए गए।", "अधिग्रहणों का उद्देश्य भारत की सीमाओं को मजबूत करना है।", "स्वदेशी खरीद और आत्मनिर्भरता पर जोर दिया गया।", "प्रमुख अधिग्रहणों में मिसाइलें और वायु रक्षा प्रणालियाँ शामिल हैं।", "रक्षा पैनल शुक्रवार को आगे के प्रस्तावों पर विचार करेगा।"], "framing": {"center": "Centrist coverage highlights the significant financial approvals for defence acquisitions, emphasizing the boost to military might and the focus on indigenous procurement and self-reliance. The framing points to the strategic strengthening of borders and overall defence capabilities."}, "framing_hi": {"center": "केंद्रवादी कवरेज रक्षा अधिग्रहणों के लिए महत्वपूर्ण वित्तीय स्वीकृतियों पर प्रकाश डालता है, जो सैन्य शक्ति को बढ़ावा देने और स्वदेशी खरीद और आत्मनिर्भरता पर ध्यान केंद्रित करने पर जोर देता है। यह कवरेज सीमाओं और समग्र रक्षा क्षमताओं के रणनीतिक सुदृढ़ीकरण की ओर इशारा करता है।"}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://c.ndtvimg.com/2019-10/haeeb8b_rajnath-singh-ndtv-file_625x300_08_October_19.jpg?im=FaceCrop,algorithm=dnn,width=1280,height=720", "sources": [{"source": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/defence-panel-to-consider-proposals-worth-over-rs-1-lakh-crore-on-friday-11714385", "headline": "Defence Panel To Consider Proposals Worth Over Rs 1 Lakh Crore On Friday"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/defence/news/pakistan-china-or-next-battlefield-why-india-is-spending-rs-52000-crore-on-the-first-100-kilometres-of-war/articleshow/132179203.cms", "headline": "Why India is spending Rs 52,000 crore on the first 100 kilometres of the battlefield"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/defence/news/how-rs-52000-crore-worth-of-equipment-will-strengthen-indias-borders/articleshow/132181958.cms", "headline": "How Rs 52,000 crore worth of equipment will strengthen India's borders"}, {"source": "The Telegraph (India)", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "German draft budget sets core defence spending, foresees over €203 billion in borrowing"}, {"source": "Business Standard", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5", "headline": "Govt clears ₹52K cr military purchase proposals for missiles, air defence"}, {"source": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/nati